			// ARMADYL_SPECIAL_ATTACK (1714) is the original AGS spec animation.
			// Current OSRS fires AGS_SPECIAL_PLAYER (7644) for the updated visuals.
			AnimationID.AGS_SPECIAL_PLAYER,          // 7644
